 "measures": [
  {
   "name": "I-35 Community School District Public Measure Z",
   "jurisdiction": "Interstate 35 Community School District (Clarke, Madison, Warren counties)",
   "ballotLanguage": "Shall the Board of Directors of the Interstate 35 Community School District in the Counties of Clarke, Madison, and Warren, State of Iowa, be authorized to contract indebtedness and issue General Obligation Bonds in an amount not to exceed $12,3000,000 to provide funds to remodel, repair, improve, and equip the school building, including reconfiguration of academic spaces, HVAC, mechanical and exterior improvements; to build, furnish, and equip athletic facilities, including a new stadium and track, parking, and site improvements, and for related improvements to repurpose the existing track and field, bleachers, and press box; and for site and access improvements to the school campus?"
  }
 ],
 "notes": "Source: Clarke County Auditor 'General Election - November 3, 2026' candidate listing on the county elections page (HTML; no sample ballot PDF posted). Supervisors elected by district: only District 2 is on the ballot (Randy Dunbar, R; no Democratic candidate); voters see only their district. Township header states 'Vote for two trustees and one clerk in your township'; '(None)' entries recorded as empty slots (write-in). Doyle Township also has a Trustee TFV (to fill vacancy) race with no candidate; its seat count is not stated. Measure amount '$12,3000,000' is copied verbatim as printed on the county page (likely a typo for $12,300,000)."
